    "description": "<p>Chronic pain, a relentless companion that lingers for weeks, months, or even years, can drastically diminish one's quality of life. It hampers daily activities, erodes mental well-being, and restricts overall functionality. At Oak Clinic, we understand the profound impact of chronic pain on individuals, both physically and emotionally. Our dedicated team is committed to providing comprehensive and personalized care.</p>",
