    "description": "<p>Anyone who has suffered from a mental health disorder knows that it affects so much more than just your mental state - it can have implications on physical health as well. &nbsp;We address healthy stress management for all patients, along with treating specific concerns such as anxiety, depression, PMDD, PPD, disordered eating, and body image issues.</p>",
