    "slug": "cardiovascular-health",
    "metaTitle": "Cardiovascular Health Support in Dawson Creek",
    "metaDescription": "Naturopaths at Oak Clinic, Dawson Creek, offer tailored support for hypertension, high cholesterol & diabetes through lifestyle guidance.",
    "description": "<p>Conditions like hypertension, high cholesterol, and diabetes can be difficult to tackle on your own, as much of the treatment is lifestyle based.&nbsp;Dr. Elena takes the confusion out of nutrition and exercise, offering individualized support.</p>",
    "icon": {
      "src": "/images/icons/iv-initial-6238d6f4.svg",
      "width": 100,
      "height": 100,
      "alt": "Cardiovascular Health"
    },
    "bookingLink": "https://oakclinic.janeapp.com/#/list",
